flowchart LR
  subgraph T1[Task 1 · Make.com]
    S[Manual / scheduled trigger] --> C[Generate synthetic contact]
    C --> A[Airtable Contacts]
    A --> O[OpenAI company summary]
    O --> D[Google Docs report]
    D --> AU[Update Airtable with summary and URL]
    DS[Daily schedule · 07:00 chosen timezone] --> Q[Query completed contacts]
    Q --> SR[Slack daily digest]
  end
  subgraph T2[Task 2 · Python]
    I[Video URL or search keyword] --> Y[YouTube Data API v3]
    Y --> N[Validate and normalize metadata]
    N --> CSV[CSV output]
    N --> GS[Optional Google Sheets append]
  end
  subgraph T3[Task 3 · Webhook]
    W[JSON + secret header] --> V[Flask validation]
    V --> SL[Slack chat.postMessage]
  end
  NOTE[External credentials and tenant configuration required] -.-> T1
  NOTE -.-> T2
  NOTE -.-> T3
